# 版本更新说明（本地维护，不随仓库发布）
版本更新说明.md

# Skills are part of the product. Always track every file under this tree,
# even when a global ignore rule would normally match its extension or folder.
!skills/
!skills/**

# Private local Skills: keep available on developer machines, never sync or ship.
skills/H3擦边导演_动作库增强版_v5.4/
skills/minnimax-h/

# Runtime output inside bundled Skills must never be published.
skills/**/output/
skills/**/scripts/_err.txt
skills/**/__pycache__/
skills/**/*.py[cod]

# The portable Windows build uses this repository-owned PyInstaller recipe.
!naiba-chat.spec

